# convex/_generated is regenerated by `npx convex dev` inside the convex-gateway
# container, which bind-mounts convex-core/convex read-write. The container writes
# LF. With core.autocrlf=true these tracked files are checked out as CRLF, so every
# gateway start flipped all five of them to "modified" in `git status` while being
# byte-identical to HEAD. Pin them to LF so the container's output and the working
# tree agree. Same reasoning as the root .gitattributes rule for *.sh.
#
# Patterns here are relative to this directory: the repo path contains a space
# ("Application Plane"), which .gitattributes patterns cannot express.
convex/_generated/** text eol=lf
